     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Advice",
     "texto": [
      "**Dovresti** (you should, to someone you address informally), **dovrebbe** (he/she should, formal). With an infinitive: **Dovresti riposare** (you should rest).",
      "It is softer than the imperative: it sounds like a suggestion."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Asking politely",
     "texto": [
      "**Potrebbe aiutarmi?** (could you help me? — formal). **Potresti aiutarmi?** (could you help me? — informal).",
      "Formally, **Mi potrebbe indicare la stazione?** (could you point out the station to me?)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
